    "description": "Erenaldi Munitions Proving Ground\n\nA deterministic, non-ending sandbox for the Nuclear Option Munitions Package. In single player, the mission pauses at the North Boscali Airbase loadout selector and resumes when you spawn the aircraft you configured. Named Primevan targets form close-air, BVR, area-ground, hardened-IADS, naval, and water-entry test zones. The remaining package weapons use these same zones as they are implemented. Restart the mission to restore targets and ammunition. The BepInEx munitions package is required on every multiplayer peer.",
